ched the top. Some say no one ever will, claiming the structure has no end at all.\nBut\u2026 what could possibly be waiting at its final height?\n\nJoin the ascent. Climb as high as you can. Break every record. Become the first in the world to reach the ultimate peak, and uncover the true story hidden behind this infinite structure.", "short_description": "Climb through an endless alien structure filled with shifting platforms, risky obstacles, and mysterious rewards. Test your skill, break global records, and push higher than anyone before. Does this tower ever end? Become the first to find out!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://leafandlight.github.io/infinity-game-privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Leaf and Light Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://leafandlight.github.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "35080804344897907"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830411_1205069364454280_3618736876582020434_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4jEPxfWpdHcQ7kNvwHU3zJF&_nc_oc=AdqeA-2fIKY2MobEG4fnVlRQTdQR-s66-5tfW2tK5bPXlkYhL-5YhNCc99MjpluAz7Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Lx80yCAd9dDRxNHdwcgm7Xs5e